### Health Check
GET https://localhost:7161/api/Health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Categories
GET https://localhost:7161/api/Category
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Category by ID
GET https://localhost:7161/api/Category/{{categoryId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Category
POST https://localhost:7161/api/Category
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electric Vehicles",
  "description": "All electric vehicle products"
}

###

### Update Category
PUT https://localhost:7161/api/Category/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electric Cars",
  "description": "Updated description for electric cars",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Delete Category
DELETE https://localhost:7161/api/Category/{{categoryId}}

###

### Get All Products
GET https://localhost:7161/api/Product
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product by ID
GET https://localhost:7161/api/Product/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Products by Category
GET https://localhost:7161/api/Product/category/{{categoryId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Product
POST https://localhost:7161/api/Product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tesla Model 3",
  "description": "Electric sedan with autopilot",
  "price": 45000,
  "stockQuantity": 50,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/tesla-model-3.jpg",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"
}

###

### Update Product
PUT https://localhost:7161/api/Product/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tesla Model 3 Long Range",
  "description": "Electric sedan with extended battery",
  "price": 50000,
  "stockQuantity": 45,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Delete Product
DELETE https://localhost:7161/api/Product/{{productId}}

###
